markdown markdown"><header><h1>Start Here</h1></header><p>GPUs offer signif=
icant performance enhancements for computationally intensive tasks. GPU cor=
es are designed for parallel computing, making them a useful tool for train=
ing machine learning models, molecular dynamics simulations, and data minin=
g. Unlike CPUs which excel at sequential tasks, GPUs can handle large numbe=
rs of simultaneous operations.</p>
<h2 class=3D"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id=3D"gpu-jobs">GPU Jobs<a=
 href=3D"https://hyak.uw.edu/docs/gpus/gpu_start#gpu-jobs" class=3D"hash-li=
nk" aria-label=3D"Direct link to GPU Jobs" title=3D"Direct link to GPU Jobs=
">=E2=80=8B</a></h2>
<p>You can view the available GPUs on Hyak with the <code>sinfo -s</code> c=
ommand. To view which GPUs are available on the <code>ckpt</code> partition=
, use:</p>
<div class=3D"codeBlockContainer_APcc theme-code-block" style=3D"--prism-co=
lor: #bfc7d5; --prism-background-color: #292d3e;"><div class=3D"codeBlockCo=
ntent_m3Ux"><pre tabindex=3D"0" class=3D"prism-code language-text codeBlock=
_qGQc thin-scrollbar" style=3D"color: rgb(191, 199, 213); background-color:=
 rgb(41, 45, 62);"><code class=3D"codeBlockLines_p187"><span class=3D"token=
-line" style=3D"color: rgb(191, 199, 213);"><span class=3D"token plain">sin=
fo -p ckpt-all -O nodehost,cpusstate,freemem,gres,gresused -S nodehost | gr=
ep -v null</span><br></span></code></pre><div class=3D"buttonGroup_6DOT"><b=
utton type=3D"button" aria-label=3D"Copy code to clipboard" title=3D"Copy" =
class=3D"clean-btn"><span class=3D"copyButtonIcons_FhaS" aria-hidden=3D"tru=
