<h3 class=3D"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id=3D"gpu-jobs-on-checkpoi=
nt">GPU Jobs on Checkpoint<a href=3D"https://hyak.uw.edu/docs/gpus/gpu_star=
t#gpu-jobs-on-checkpoint" class=3D"hash-link" aria-label=3D"Direct link to =
GPU Jobs on Checkpoint" title=3D"Direct link to GPU Jobs on Checkpoint">=E2=
=80=8B</a></h3>
<p>A GPU job can be requested from <code>ckpt</code> by specifying the type=
 and number of GPUs to allocate with the tag <code>--gpus-per-node</code>:<=
/p>
<div class=3D"codeBlockContainer_APcc theme-code-block" style=3D"--prism-co=
lor: #bfc7d5; --prism-background-color: #292d3e;"><div class=3D"codeBlockCo=
ntent_m3Ux"><pre tabindex=3D"0" class=3D"prism-code language-text codeBlock=
_qGQc thin-scrollbar" style=3D"color: rgb(191, 199, 213); background-color:=
 rgb(41, 45, 62);"><code class=3D"codeBlockLines_p187"><span class=3D"token=
-line" style=3D"color: rgb(191, 199, 213);"><span class=3D"token plain">sal=
loc --partition=3Dckpt-all --gpus-per-node=3D2080ti:1 --mem=3D10G --time=3D=
2:00:00 </span><br></span></code></pre><div class=3D"buttonGroup_6DOT"><but=
ton type=3D"button" aria-label=3D"Copy code to clipboard" title=3D"Copy" cl=
