<h3 class=3D"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id=3D"gpu-jobs-on-a-specif=
ic-gpu-partition">GPU Jobs on a Specific GPU Partition<a href=3D"https://hy=
ak.uw.edu/docs/gpus/gpu_start#gpu-jobs-on-a-specific-gpu-partition" class=
=3D"hash-link" aria-label=3D"Direct link to GPU Jobs on a Specific GPU Part=
ition" title=3D"Direct link to GPU Jobs on a Specific GPU Partition">=E2=80=
=8B</a></h3>
<p>If you have a GPU partition, you can start an interactive session on a G=
PU node by using the following command:</p>
<div class=3D"codeBlockContainer_APcc theme-code-block" style=3D"--prism-co=
lor: #bfc7d5; --prism-background-color: #292d3e;"><div class=3D"codeBlockCo=
ntent_m3Ux"><pre tabindex=3D"0" class=3D"prism-code language-text codeBlock=
_qGQc thin-scrollbar" style=3D"color: rgb(191, 199, 213); background-color:=
 rgb(41, 45, 62);"><code class=3D"codeBlockLines_p187"><span class=3D"token=
-line" style=3D"color: rgb(191, 199, 213);"><span class=3D"token plain">sal=
loc --account=3Daccount --partition=3Dgpu-rtx6k --gpus=3D1 --mem=3D10G --ti=
me=3D2:00:00</span><br></span><span class=3D"token-line" style=3D"color: rg=
b(191, 199, 213);"><span class=3D"token plain"># Replace the account and pa=
rtition flags to match your account and partitions.</span><br></span></code=
></pre><div class=3D"buttonGroup_6DOT"><button type=3D"button" aria-label=
=3D"Copy code to clipboard" title=3D"Copy" class=3D"clean-btn"><span class=
=3D"copyButtonIcons_FhaS" aria-hidden=3D"true"><svg viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" c=
lass=3D"copyButtonIcon_phi_"><path fill=3D"currentColor" d=3D"M19,21H8V7H19=
M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5=
M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24"=
