7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></=
button></div></div></div>
<p>If you are unsure if your accounts have GPU partitions, use the <code>hy=
akalloc</code> command to see all of your available resources. A detailed w=
alkthrough for requesting a GPU job can be found <a href=3D"https://hyak.uw=
.edu/docs/hyak101/basics/jobs/#requesting-gpus-from-a-gpu-partition" target=
=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer"><strong>HERE</strong></a>.</p>
